title: Extortion Contact Referencing Leaked Data via Known Actor Infrastructure
id: 7c9d1e2f-3a4b-4c6d-e5f6-8a9b0c1d2e08
status: experimental
description: Detects inbound email or web-form contact referencing stolen data and directing the recipient to a Tox ID or ShinyHunters-branded leak site, confirming the extortion stage has begun.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://securityboulevard.com/2026/05/shinyhunters-the-group-behind-300-breaches/
tags:
    - attack.impact
    - attack.t1657
logsource:
    category: email
    service: gateway
detection:
    selection:
        Body|contains:
            - 'Tox ID'
            - 'leak site'
            - 'ShinyHunters'
            - 'ShinySp1d3r'
    condition: selection
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate security researcher or journalist correspondence referencing the group by name
level: high
